  "description": "If your adventures include rough road surfaces or bumpy dirt paths, the 26-inch wheels of the 2014 Lxi 6.1 feature 2.125-inch tread width for superior traction and off-road comfort. An upright seating position with comfortable saddle, suspension seatpost and front suspension fork with lockout further enhance the off-road comfort of the Lxi 6.1. To help make molehills out of mountains, a smooth-shifting and quiet 7 speed Shimano drivetrain further enhances the go-anywhere attitude of the Lxi 6.1.\nDel Sol Lightweight 6061 aluminum exclusive upright comfort frame\nCustom Del Sol comfort plush saddle with suspension seat post\nUltra-compliant 50mm travel suspension fork\nShimano Altus rear derailleur powered by Shimano\nShimano 7 speed Revo Twist shifters\nAlloy adjustable rise comfort stem\nSmooth rolling 26-inch all-purpose tires on double-wall alloy rims",
